# 🌑 AETHERIA — MASTER SYSTEM

> **The Master is not a hero.**
>
> **The Master commands the heroes.**
>
> In a world that has already ended, the Master is the one chosen by the Game Master System to gather survivors, manage the Tower, make decisions, and lead the final attempt to defeat Nythar.

---

# 1. MASTER SYSTEM OVERVIEW

The **Master System** manages everything related to the player identity known as:

# **THE MASTER**

The Master is the central player entity in Aetheria.

The Master does not function as an ordinary combat character.

Instead, the Master acts as:

```text
Commander
Manager
Decision Maker
Party Leader
World Explorer
Quest Controller
Resource Manager
Character Manager
Tower Challenger
```

The Master controls the heroes, but the heroes remain independent characters with their own:

```text
Personality
History
Relationships
Motivation
Loyalty
Abilities
Memories
Decisions
```

---

