# 47. MASTER SECURITY

The Master System should validate player actions.

Example:

```text
Player requests:

Gold = 1,000,000
```

but Database says:

```text
Gold = 10,000
```

The request is rejected.

Another example:

```text
Player requests:

Floor 80
```

but Game State says:

```text
Highest Floor = 20
```

The request is rejected.

