# 🌑 68. CORE PHILOSOPHY

The Master System follows one fundamental principle:

> **The Master is the player entity, not the world itself.**

The Master can command heroes.

The Master can make decisions.

The Master can influence factions.

The Master can climb the Tower.

But every action creates consequences that are processed by the **Game State System**.

```text
MASTER ACTION
      ↓
MASTER SYSTEM
      ↓
GAME STATE SYSTEM
      ↓
WORLD REACTION
      ↓
EVENT / AI / RNG
      ↓
CONSEQUENCE
      ↓
DATABASE
```

